                                "sense_id": "8d59c62e-b63a-3cae-b96f-e6a7f6af57d7",
                                "text": "The fundamental component of the protozoan body is the protoplasm which is without exception differentiated into the nucleus and the cytosome."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
